            "line": 865,
            "text": "theorem inverse_finiteJets (d : Direction) (n : ℕ) :\n    ∃ K : ℝ, 0 ≤ K ∧ ∀ (f : Source P) (S : Set P) (C : ℝ),\n      ContDiff ℝ ∞ f → Periodic f → 0 ≤ C →\n      JetBound f S (n + 5) C → JetBound (inverse d f) S n (K * C)"
